      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Do those Avatars have a Dynamic / Phys Bone component on any of the humanoid bones (e.g. hip, head, ...)? Or do they have one of these set as a root Dynamic / Phys Bone?\nPhys Bones allow the root bone to rotate which would break these setups. If that’s the case I would recommend to put all of the things that should be effected by Phys Bones in an empty object and set the root bone as that empty object.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
