      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: I do not know, they are public avatars and not my own creation. I just know that when I am in the open-beta they have like I said broken necks where their heads go all floppy, unable to sit as in even though they are supposed to sit they just stand in a weird pose, move as in unable to walk properly etc. When in the normal VRChat they are perfectly fine and don't have any problems. The only Dynamic bones they have are within the ears and hair which don't have any problems.",
