      "value": "@{623124e6ff80085282df15df|full_name}: You can get the avatar ID for a public avatar by changing to it, then going to the vrchat website at https://vrchat.com/home/avatars, and copying the link to the avatar under 'current avatar'. Adding the public avatar IDs will probably help the devs track down the issue.",
